::  name       layout row ceiling gate
::  shape      row - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while the row stays at or under 7; answers 0 past the
::  grid
::  law        brushstroke/skate_cell_grid.rye grid_rows=8 (0-indexed)
::  example    0 -> 1 - 7 -> 1 - 8 -> 0
::  readers    Brushstroke - Skate - Glow layout
::  nib        glow-language journey Orbit 10 -- layout shapes (20261104)
::
::  Skate's cell grid is 8 rows tall. A row index is valid from
::  0 through 7. This gate refuses anything past the last row.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (gth sample 7)  0  1
